;color:#66786f;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;\">TOP MANAGEMENT PRIORITY</div><div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;\">{{ $json.brief.recommended_focus?.title || 'No current management priority' }}</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#126441;margin-top:8px;\">{{ $json.brief.recommended_focus?.resolution_blocked ? 'EVIDENCE PENDING' : 'EVIDENCE CURRENT' }}</div><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#43564c;\">{{ $json.brief.recommended_focus?.reason || 'No material priority is currently available.' }}</p><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#66786f;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;margin-top:18px;\">RECOMMENDED RESPONSE</div><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;\">{{ $json.brief.recommended_focus?.recommended_action || 'Continue monitoring the next analytical refresh.' }}</p><hr style=\"border:0;border-top:1px solid #e4ece7;margin:24px 0;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#66786f;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;\">DECISION EVIDENCE</div><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><b>Analytical period:</b> {{ $json.current_period.start }} - {{ $json.current_period.end }}<br><b>Evidence posture:</b> {{ $json.evidence.status }}<br><b>Blocking datasets:</b> {{ ($json.evidence.blocking_datasets || []).join(', ') || 'None' }}</p><div style=\"background:#fff8e9;border:1px solid #eed9ab;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;color:#704908;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;\">{{ $json.brief.evidence_blocked_risk_count }} prior issue(s) remain open because required evidence is not current. The system has not inferred resolution from missing data.</div><p style=\"margin-top:24px;\"><a href=\"{{ $('Workflow Configuration').first().json.dashboard_url }}/investigate/{{ $json.brief.recommended_focus?.insight_id || '' }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0b6b4c;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;\">Open management cockpit</a></p></div><div style=\"background:#f7faf8;padding:16px 30px;color:#7a8a82;font-size:11px;border-top:1px solid #e4ece7;\">Generated automatically from deterministic business intelligence. KPI calculations remain governed by the analytics engine; this email is the management delivery layer.</div></div></div>",
